# layout for atlas-build. Order matters — the FIRST section is the homepage.
#
#   == <id> [flags] | <Tab label> | <lede shown under the tabs>
#   <partial>.html            one per line, relative to sections/
#
# flags: wide  -> single-column grid (for full-width tables)
# Comments (#) and blank lines ignored.

== home | home | Every host and what it serves. Links here can be pinned to the rail and open in-page.
hosts.html
about.html

== keys wide | keys | Keybinds, one table per app.
keys.html
